# (not Calcite-specific) while porting Calcite's rules: RelRN.scanMany
# (multi-column scan), the RelRN.project(Seq<RexRN>)/ProjectMany overload
# (multi-column projection), and RelRN.Correlate (a real dependent join,
# needed for JoinToCorrelate — see calcite/rules/JoinToCorrelate/REPORT.md
